      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thanks so much for telling me that! That really means a lot to me. I hope we can plan for the weekend soon.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T03:28:08.166316+00:00"
    },
    {
