      "created_at": "2026-09-14T04:04:04.260055+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "I would totally love that! I've been thinking about trying some new recipes for the dinner, and having a romantic meal with you. How about we start with Italian cuisine? What do you think?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T04:06:58.564996+00:00"
    },
