      "id": 27,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh wow, I didn't know you were a vegetarian! That is so cool and impressive. What kind of dishes do you enjoy eating in Italy or other countries? My mom used to make pasta all the time for me.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T06:02:38.994785+00:00"
