    {
      "id": 29,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, I've been making them for a while now. My mom always made pasta for me. You know, she made it very well.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T06:14:55.628802+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh my gosh, your mom really made the best pasta ever. What was her secret recipe?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T06:16:46.351299+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh wow, your mom made pasta so well. I've heard that before, but the recipe seems unique. What do you think her secret might have been?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T06:40:44.818354+00:00"
    },
